sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Viewer
  participant D as BeeReviewDialog
  participant API as API · bee_review
  participant SRC as Catalog + comments
  participant F as FallbackInsightGenerator
  participant L as LLM adapter (cached)
  participant HF as HuggingFace router
  participant R as RuleBasedInsightGenerator
  U->>D: "Bee Review" · toggle viewers' opinions
  D->>API: GET /shows/{id}/review?includeComments=true
  API->>SRC: summary + genres · up to 20 newest comments
  API->>F: generate(InsightSubject)
  F->>L: generate
  alt AI insight cached (1 h)
    L-->>F: Insight · source=ai
  else circuit closed
    L->>HF: POST /chat/completions · system + user prompt
    alt 200 with text
      HF-->>L: choices[0].message.content
      L-->>F: Insight · source=ai (cached)
    else error · 429 · timeout · empty output
      L-->>F: InsightGenerationError
      F->>R: generate (deterministic, offline)
      R-->>F: Insight · source=fallback
    end
  else circuit open (3 failures → 30 s)
    L-->>F: fail fast · no network call
    F->>R: generate
    R-->>F: Insight · source=fallback
  end
  F-->>API: Insight
  API-->>D: 200 {text, source, generator, commentsConsidered}
  D-->>U: review + "AI insight" or "Bee's instinct" chip
